---

Edit the BassSanctum config after first launch:

- **Portal block** — the block players right-click to enter the dimension.
- **Altar item** — any item ID. Common pack use is a boss summoning item.

There is no bundled quest line. Combine it with [EpicQuest Hub](/mods/epicquest-hub) or [EventMaker](/mods/eventmaker) if the sanctum is one stop in a larger progression.
